# Back to Life Mental Health — Cloudflare Pages redirects
#
# The canonical public URLs match the repository's top-level HTML filenames
# without the .html extension. Cloudflare Pages serves those extensionless
# routes natively and redirects direct .html requests automatically.
#
# Keep legacy Odoo redirects direct to the final canonical destination so
# search engines and visitors do not pass through redirect chains.

# Image asset recovery
# Two temporary JPG copies created during image placement were malformed.
# Keep the page markup stable while routing those requests to the original,
# full-resolution PNG image data.
